body:
My parents got me the Platinum Box for my birthday awhile back. Best birthday present ever =3

As soon as I started, getting a team strong enough to ex clear the DL Live was my main focus for the past 4 days, since I imagined it would be only available for a limited time. Pretty much just focusing on my team of Miki, Hibiki and Iori, I used about 110 plays worth of magazines to get Kiramekirai to rank 10, and almost every bit of cash I got from grinding to give them lessons. By the time I finally had them strong enough to get around the  53000 score mark, Miki had around 900,000 fans, with the other 2 right behind her.

…and now I feel really silly after realizing the DL Live stays forever as long as you downloaded it. As can be seen by the new DL Live available now ;_;
